{"id": "34205", "title": "七年情债(黑寡妇3)", "author": "白双", "category": "文学名著", "count": 42, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34205/34205s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34205.htm", "intro": "有谁不知道攸关钱财之事,她看得比生命重要，况且她开设的是借贷公司,又不是救济院。教唆黑道份子代为讨债属天经地义，他竟敢挡她财路,真是不要命！可恶啊??她还没跟他清算旧债。他现下居然把她的打手全吸收到御龙帮！哼！也不打听打听她艾若乔是啥人物。这些帐已算在他头上,他不还都不行！…… \r\n　　他不认为暴力能解决问题,加上又好管闲事，因此决定以「柔性诉求」让她改邪归正，但……她这小辣椒实在太呛了。他都已经释出善意,她居然还故意搞破坏让他难为，得想法子教训她才行！嘻嘻嘻??对付个守财奴。当然没有比教她荷包大失血更有用了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34205", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2173190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2173191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2173192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2173193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2173194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2173195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2173196.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2173197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2173198.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2173199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2173200.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2173201.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2173202.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2173203.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2173204.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2173205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2173206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2173207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2173208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2173209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2173210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2173211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2173212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页",